    {
      "source": "Configure the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/Environment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>Environment</code></a> to use. Defaults to <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/core/env/StandardEnvironment.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.core.env\"><code>StandardEnvironment</code></a> if not configured.",
